  m_Name: Text_BeatenWorker_BarnTally
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: Grain? That'll be Brann, then. Everything in this camp that's sold after dark goes through his hands. And he's careful with it, counts it all twice like your reeve does, and chalks every sack on a little slip so nobody can cheat him.
